<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Grupo Elektra lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Grupo Elektra lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SBC Warburg said it downgraded Grupo Elektra SA de CV to add from a buy.</p>
<p>-- Said the firm's new price target on the stock of 76.00 pesos or $19.44 per ADR allows for an upside potential of only 12.7 percent.</p>
<p>-- The stock was not immediately open in U.S. trading after closing Monday at 17-1/4.</p>
</text>
